    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "# Choosing a Good Name\r\n\r\nIt's important for images to have good names, ones that are easy to understand and use characters that are good for links.  This project's image names have some problems.\r\n\r\n# Do This\r\n\r\n1) For each image, fix the name according to the following rules:\r\n   * Avoid special characters such as `&`, `?`, `%`, `/`, `(`, etc.\r\n   * Make sure the name has a specific meaning that helps you know what the image is.\r\n   * Use dashes (`-`) or underscores (`_`) instead of spaces.\r\n   * Keep the names as short as possible and still have a clear meaning.\r\n* Choose your favorite image and add it to the web page.\r\n   * Don't forget the attribution!\r\n\r\nImage        |     Amphibian    |     Attribution   \r\n-----|-------|------\r\n![](https://images.code.org/31687e55efb5efae6bb9826261c7cd82-image-1565125236060.jpg) | &nbsp; &nbsp;**kani bushfrog**&nbsp; &nbsp; | Rison Thumboor - Wikimedia Commons - CC-BY-SA\r\n![](https://images.code.org/8414d11eb143e3ef2a8fd3f67922774e-image-1565124534341.png) | &nbsp; &nbsp;**paedophryne amauensis**&nbsp; &nbsp; |Rittmeyer EN, Allison A, Gründler MC, Thompson DK, Austin CC - Wikimedia Commons - CC-BY\r\n![](https://images.code.org/695749afb3107d506c340b2e6b215307-image-1565124851451.jpg) | &nbsp; &nbsp;**red eyed tree frog**&nbsp; &nbsp; | Carey James Balboa - Wikimedia Commons - Public Domain\r\n![](https://images.code.org/9ba9eee1e7eb7e706dcab14714401207-image-1565124855000.jpg) | &nbsp; &nbsp;**fire salamander**&nbsp; &nbsp; | Cristo Vlahos - Wikimedia Commons - CC-BY\r\n![](https://images.code.org/512a972eb6d9ef431e648d01a0efc6cc-image-1565124857450.jpg) | &nbsp; &nbsp;**axolotl**&nbsp; &nbsp; | th1098 - Wikimedia Commons - CC-BY-SA\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n::: details [🔎 **Show Me How** 🔍]\r\n\r\n![](https://images.code.org/58dad1ddaa62ca2347bc9210d3f502e6-image-1769393635995.5.gif):::\r\n\r\n::: details [Help & Tips]\r\n- [<i class=\"fa-regular fa-map\"></i> Images in HTML](https://studio.code.org/courses/csd-2024/guides/images-in-html)\r\n- [<i class=\"fa-solid fa-book\"></i> Creative Commons Search](https://studio.code.org/courses/csd-2024/guides/creative-commons-search)\r\n- [<i class=\"fa-solid fa-book\"></i> Style Sheets](https://studio.code.org/courses/csd-2024/guides/style-sheets)\r\n- [<i class=\"fa-solid fa-book\"></i> Text Properties](https://studio.code.org/courses/csd-2024/guides/text-properties)\r\n- [<i class=\"fa-solid fa-book\"></i> Formatting HTML](https://studio.code.org/courses/csd-2024/guides/formatting-html)\r\n- [<i class=\"fa-solid fa-book\"></i> Lists](https://studio.code.org/courses/csd-2024/guides/lists)\r\n- [<i class=\"fa-solid fa-book\"></i> Headings and Paragraphs](https://studio.code.org/courses/csd-2024/guides/headings-and-paragraphs)\r\n- [<i class=\"fa-solid fa-book\"></i> HTML Tags](https://studio.code.org/courses/csd-2024/guides/html-tags)\r\n- [<i class=\"fa-solid fa-book\"></i> Debugging in HTML](https://studio.code.org/courses/csd-2022/guides/debugging-html)\r\n:::",
